AUDIO: 'I actually met Eugene [music] the night before filming to get the keys to the house and didn\'t end up doing a fake intro thing with him the next day. So, we\'re just going to start all killer, no filler [music] style. &gt;&gt; This house was designed for my parents'

[03:24] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'back in 1991. My parents wanted to move from Minneapolis, Minnesota to Berkeley, California. And they knew about the earthquakes and the natural disasters that would happen here, and they wanted'

[03:37] [scene:talk]
