AUDIO: 'a house that was absolutely safe. They wanted to be in a kind of cocoon-like environment where noise and the the roar of life was quieted and insulated from their day-to-day lives. I first studied'

[03:51] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'what in nature is the most indestructible creature or organism. And I found out that it\'s the tardigrade. They thrive in every kind of moist environment in the world. They can withstand minus 273°'

[04:04] [scene:talk]
