AUDIO: 'C and they can also withstand boiling toxic gas. The body of the tardigrade is a parabola on top and a catenary arch on'

[04:16] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'the bottom and I thought that makes perfect sense because the parabola and the catenary are nature\'s most elegant geometries that can dissipate forces from from any direction. So, the'

[04:31] [scene:talk]
